    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.725,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "这两天我们去杨树河看子，除了西安的葡萄丰收了，杨树的黄皮果呢也是丰收了。",
      "score": 0.1855,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1538,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1354,
        "sc_delta": 0.0184,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.117,
        "seg_cer": 0.273,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "今天我们去阳朔去看下子。除了西安的葡萄丰收了，阳朔的放皮果呢也是丰收了。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 5.725,
      "end": 10.085,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "一眼望过去啊，到处的果树啊都挂满了金灿灿的黄皮果，",
      "score": 0.0199,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0199,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0201,
        "sc_delta": -0.0001,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.043,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "一眼望过去啊，到处的果树啊，都挂满了金灿灿的放皮果。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 10.085,
      "end": 14.032,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "长得是特别的好。果农们呢也在忙到采摘装筐，",
      "score": 0.3886,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.259,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2858,
        "sc_delta": -0.0268,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.44,
        "seg_cer": 0.421,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "涨得是特别的好，股东们呢也在忙着猜测状况。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 14.256,
      "end": 16.948,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "一筐筐黄皮果呢也达到丰收的喜悦，",
      "score": 0.4194,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3405,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3329,
        "sc_delta": 0.0075,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.689,
